  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum amplitude for an amplitude modulated wave is found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> while the minimum amplitude is found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. The modulation index is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">A</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Modulation index <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
